# Stage 4 goal, Wurstkranz zone (D-038; game-design.md sec. 6): the solver
# route onto the Aberseeblick (row 10, 6 tiles above the meadow), where
# Resi stops, walks back to the rock's left end and takes a held running
# jump off its right edge: she grabs the Maibaum high enough for the
# Wurstkranz, 5000 points (complete at 1640, score 11000; walking off the
# same rock scores 100, falkenstein_goal_walk_off). Run-ups of 16 to 24
# frames all reach it. If the solver route changes, re-copy the prefix and
# re-check the frames.
level  = falkenstein
seed   = 1
source = handwritten
expect = complete frames=1640..1640 score=11000 deaths=0 state=stage_clear
